    mir_declaration_field_offset_identity_mismatch_2026_11_14, 0, "Source audit: declaration small:u8 wide:u64 yields physical wide@0 small@8; lower_struct_type and lower_class_type incorrectly zip declaration and physical indices. Correcting offsets reveals CUDA last-declaration-field end size8 instead of maxend rounded16. No runtime proof yet."

